          <div class="answer-card">
            <h2 class="card-question">Will foundation repair fix my sticking doors or cracked walls?</h2>
            <div class="card-answer">
              <p>Structural repair stabilizes the foundation. Cosmetic finishes may not return to perfect alignment. We explain what to expect before you commit — not after.</p>
              <div class="nm-note">NM context: If a door frame has been distorted for years, it may remain out of square after stabilization.</div>
              <div class="industry-note">A company that promises every door will close perfectly after repair is overpromising. Structural repair stabilizes; cosmetic finishes may not return. We tell you the truth up front.</div>
            </div>
