            <div class="card-answer">
              <p>In some cases, consistent moisture can reduce clay shrinkage. In others, it triggers heave. Do not start a watering regimen without understanding your soil type.</p>
              <div class="nm-note">NM context: Over‑watering expansive clay can cause heave. Know your soil first.</div>
              <div class="industry-note">Without knowing your soil, watering can cause the very heave you're trying to prevent. Get the soil data first.</div>
